WEBVTT

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:20.690
Things are moving so fast.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.360
The moments ticking by.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.190
I'm running through this city.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.030
To me, a savanna.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:27.360
Like it's struggling...

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.360
... trying to break free...

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:32.700
... I wanna test all this power!

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.370
I know that "The Answer"...

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:36.700
... is out there someplace.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:40.040
The answer that everyone looks for...

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.540
... from the day they're born.

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.210
When all looks lost...

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.710
... and there's no escape...

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:49.380
... I turn to my dreams!

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:53.220
I'm not afraid of getting hurt...

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:56.560
... but I'm not strong, either.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:00.060
It's just that I can't stand...

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:03.500
... just doing nothing anymore!

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.000
Here we go, go! I'll just run on...

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.670
... and let nobody stop me now!

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.840
I wanna find the me in the future...

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:19.010
... and give her a reason for life!

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:33.190
To defeat the immortaI Halcyform...

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:35.020
... we had to sneak into his mansion...

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:37.530
... and smash the Pledge Stone.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.360
At the last possible moment
we figured out that...

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.200
... the Pledge Stone
was Saygram's mask...

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.200
... and were able
to beat Halcyform.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.870
And our payment for this? Nothing?

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.200
I guess that's what you'd
call a wasted effort.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:56.280
"You Can't Escape!
The Return of the Obsessive Martina!"

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:04.150
We've finally found it, Amelia.

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.650
Yes. The thing we've dreamed of.

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:09.820
The All-You- Can-Eat
For- A-Silver-Piece restaurant!

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:11.660
Is your stomach ready?

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:13.490
Yup, everything's A-OK!

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:15.000
Then let's go!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.000
- Ready, Set...
- Ready, Set...

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.000
Hold it.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:23.500
Don't tell me we had to
come here just for this!

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:24.670
So what if we did?

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:26.000
I see.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:31.010
I told you I'm trying to get to
Seyruun as fast as possible...

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:34.020
...so I can find a way to turn
myself back to normal!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.850
I don't need to travel
to get a big meal!

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:39.020
It's not "a big meal."
It's all you can eat!

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:40.350
Like there's a difference?!

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:43.190
There's no harm doing this.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.690
Seyruun isn't going to run away.

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:48.700
And why do you have
to come with us?!

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:52.370
Because I also happen to have some
business in the direction of Seyruun.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:53.530
So I thought I'd join you.

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.200
What sort of business?

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:56.870
That's a secret.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:03:00.980
I suppose it has to do with looking
for the Claire Bible manuscript?

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.310
Well, that's one way of putting it.

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:04.980
Anyway, until we meet again.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:05.810
Huh?

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:07.640
Hey! Wait!

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:16.490
I hate to say it, but there's nothing
we can do about him.

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:18.660
We'll have to wait
for our chance to come.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:19.660
Anyway, one more time.

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:21.330
- Ready, set...
- Ready, set...

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.160
Oh, wait, please!

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.170
What is up with this girl?

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.840
I think the word "suspicious"
was invented just for her!

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:36.170
Oh, I like you so much!
Wouldn't you like my treasure?

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:41.680
Hey! Isn't that one of the legendary
gold pieces of Rahga?

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:44.350
Oh, yes! I'd love to have that!

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:47.190
Oh, well, then trade
me something for it!

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.860
Gets right to the point,
doesn't she?

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:55.530
Show something shiny to Lina
and that's all she'll think about.

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:58.530
Let's see, something to trade...

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:00.360
Oh! This would do nicely!

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.800
There you go. Bye!

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:03.640
Hey! Wait!

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:06.140
Wait!

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:07.470
Get down!

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:13.650
What happened?!

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:16.820
I don't care if anyone steals
the jewels on my shoulders...

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:19.820
...since they're fakes that
explode when you remove them.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:20.990
That's why I tried to stop them...

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.480
You mean... Mr. Gourry!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.650
Hey!

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.000
Don't try to move!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.490
Gourry!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.170
Hey! Here! Over here!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.170
You okay?

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.840
Sure, and I caught the thief, too! Look!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:43.830
Where?

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.020
For Pete's sake!
You're as dumb as ever!

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:52.020
First of all, she didn't steal anything...

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.850
...so you didn't have to go after her!

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.010
Let's go!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:01.460
Darn it! My plan failed!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.630
But it'll take more than
this to make me give up!

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:07.130
I will take one of Lina's possessions,
no matter what!

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:10.800
Ever since the day you destroyed
my castle in Xoana...

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:17.980
I lost my fortune, my kingdom, my home!

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:20.140
Forced to wander the roads!

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:32.990
Penniless. Hungry. Cold.

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:36.500
For a former member of royalty,
it's been the tortures of hell!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.500
And within that place, I swore!

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:43.170
That I would curse you to death
and have my vengeance!

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.340
And then, at long last...

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:48.180
...I completed the cursed dagger
of the monstrous Zoamelgustar!

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.340
With this dagger, once I've taken
one of Lina's possessions...

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:53.340
...the curse will be complete! But...

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:58.020
But I couldn't get one thing of hers!
Oh, the indignity of it all!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.020
And on top of that,
her companions...

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:00.610
Companions?

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:03.610
That man...

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.960
Gourry's his name, I think.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:12.470
Wha- What's wrong with me?!
He's one of Lina's friends!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:15.300
Just you wait, Lina Inverse!

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:17.630
I shall be the one
who will kill you!

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.140
I, Martina!

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:39.990
For Pete's sake,
with all the fuss Gourry...

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:41.830
...and the others raised,
we never got a chance to eat!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:45.660
Oh, well, we can eat
there tomorrow.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:51.670
Hmm, not too bad.
Have they grown a little-?

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:53.510
Miss Lina! What are you doing?!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.840
Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:57.010
This bath's huge
and the water feels so good!

00:06:57.010 --> 00:07:00.450
Right, right. Jeez,
she can be such a little kid.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.950
Miss Lina!

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:10.290
Yeesh! A little kid with
annoyingly large breasts!

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.300
Even after all the camping out we do...

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:21.470
...you still have such clear skin, Miss Lina.

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:23.300
I'm just made differently, I guess.

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:25.640
I'll say. You're not exactly
the delicate type.

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:26.970
What did you say?!

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:33.150
Yes, a metal brush is
a bit harsh, after all.

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:34.650
And there's you, Amelia.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.150
What?

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.150
Your hair is so shiny and pretty.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:41.820
Oh, you think so?!
It's sort of my pride.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:44.310
I guess you don't have
much stress in your life...

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:50.660
Split ends?

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:53.330
Miss Lina, please stop!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:56.670
You love it, don't you?! Don't' you?

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:03.780
If you're in the bath, you naturally
leave your belongings outside.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:04.450
Now, then the girls' bath is...

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:06.780
Say, are the baths this way?

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:13.620
Y- You!

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:16.620
Uh, oh, no! I'm not up
to anything suspicious!

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:18.290
I'm a maid here at the inn!

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:20.460
Would you have any laundry for me?

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:24.130
Laundry? Uh, sure.
Take this, would you?

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:25.620
And this... and this.

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:29.960
Hi!

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.310
Hey, are you all right?

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:33.640
Do you have a fever?

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:44.490
These mighty arms...
This powerful body...

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:45.470
This handsome face...

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:48.820
Looks like nothing's wrong with you.

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.150
Well, take care of it, okay?

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.500
Oh, Zelgadis. Don't get out.
I'm just coming in.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.500
Don't be ridiculous.
I'm already out!

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:02.940
Such a powerful man...
Those mighty muscles...

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:05.270
It must be the sort of body
my heaven would grant...

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.780
... to a child of Zoamelgustar!

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:10.780
Oh, why?! Why must we be enemies?!

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:14.950
If only you weren't Lina's friend!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:18.290
That's it! It'll be fine
if he wasn't Lina's friend!

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.960
Isn't that right,
Lord Zoamelgustar?

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:25.290
Once I kill Lina, he won't
be her friend anymore!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.960
And then he would be worthy
of entering my heaven!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.130
Yes! You're completely right, Martina!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:34.970
All right, then let's get one
of Lina's possessions quickly...

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.800
...and complete casting this curse!

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.470
Where is... Lina?

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.490
You there, villain!
Prepare to die!

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:09.670
S- Sleeptalking?

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:13.330
Who's a villain, you stupid...

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.520
Curse you, Lina Inverse!

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:25.020
Just you wait! I'll complete this curse soon!

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:26.850
O Monstrous Zoamelgustar!

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:31.690
Bring down the power of this
curse upon Lina Inverse!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.030
Lina Inverse!

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:38.200
Feel the torment of my curse!

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.540
And once you are dead...

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:45.030
...Master Gourry and I
shall be together!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.150
Morning.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.830
What happened to your face, Amelia?

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:15.170
You don't remember, do you?

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:18.170
Don't you feel sorry for Amelia?

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.670
There are limits you just
don't cross, you know!

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.680
Whoa, whoa, hold it!
What're you all talking about?

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.350
Miss Lina...

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.010
You toss and turn way too much!

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:39.360
I had no choice but to tie
you down to the bed.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:44.030
Then, just before morning,
I untied you without you realizing it.

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.030
Oh?

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:48.540
So you just had me
tied up all night, huh?!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.540
You've got a lot of nerve to do that!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.710
I'm sorry! I did it in self-defense!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:57.210
You gotta get up pretty early in
the morning to put one over on me-

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:58.870
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:03.320
No fair, Miss Lina!
That's going too far!

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.650
Huh? Why do I hurt? Huh?

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:14.660
Oh, well! Let's leave the weird stuff
for later and have some breakfast!

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:18.000
By the way, what happened
to your bandana?

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.500
Oh, that thing?
Couldn't find it.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:22.170
You seen it, Amelia?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.170
No, I haven't.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:27.170
That's why I always say leaving your clothes
all over the place is a bad habit!

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:30.340
Yeah, just like my sister used to say.

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:33.340
Even if she didn't get so mad,
I still wouldn't apologize for it.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:39.680
I was just about to eat that!

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:46.360
Miss Lina!

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:48.350
Could it be?!

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:03.640
Lina!

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:04.810
Miss Lina!

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:05.650
Hey! Are you all right?!

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:08.320
I didn't do anything!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:11.320
I know... What's going on?

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:14.980
It would appear that you're
under some strange spell.

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:19.330
Hi!

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:20.490
Xellos!

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:22.160
You! When did you show up?!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.160
What sort of "strange spell"?!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:28.000
I'd hazard to guess...
A curse of some sort.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.660
A curse?!

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.680
It seems that you've
figured part of it out.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.840
But as long as I have this,
it will do you no good!

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:46.520
It would appear that any time
Lina hurts someone...

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:51.860
...the power of the curse will magnify it
and revisit back onto her.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:54.360
Magnify and revisit it onto her?

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:56.030
What do you mean?

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:58.870
Let's try a direct demonstration.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:02.800
Wow, they're small.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.640
Yeah, they are kinda small-

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:07.470
What?! What are you doing?!

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:13.640
That... really... hurts...

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.320
That... really...

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:21.150
I believe that demonstrates it.

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:21.990
I see...

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:24.990
You coulda just described it, you know?!

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:28.000
Demonstrations make it much
easier to understand.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:31.160
But who did this to me?

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:41.010
You! That really suspicious girl
from yesterday!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:44.010
Huh? You've met her?

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.350
Who are you?

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:47.510
Sometimes I'm a lovely foreigner.

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:50.020
Sometimes, I'm a faithful maid.

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:51.510
And sometimes, I'm the real me!

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:04.290
It's been a long time, Lina Inverse.

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:09.640
Who are you?

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:12.970
Martina! Don't tell me
you've forgotten about me!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.980
The former princess of Xoana castle,
which you destroyed.

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:19.480
Oh! Yeah, I did that, didn't I?
Wow, nostalgia trip.

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.320
So, what's up? How's life?

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:23.650
Don't try to act friendly to me!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:28.660
No matter. Now that you're under
the curse of Zoamelgustar...

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:33.160
...you're as good as in my power!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:37.160
You're saying you're responsible
for this wacky curse being on me?!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.830
But...

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:43.670
Didn't she say Zoamelgustar was
a totally made-up monster?

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.340
She must have really hated Lina.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:49.680
She was able to complete
the curse with pure obsession.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.510
Rather original, actually.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:56.180
How can you fight when any pain you
inflict gets visited back onto you?

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.350
Monster, dears!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.520
Time to come out!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:00.190
Whoa, look at 'em all!

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:03.290
She got a lot to work for her!
Impressive!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:06.950
Hmpf! Money can buy you
practically everything!

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.800
Don't act like such a big shot!

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:16.300
I certainly will! I raised that money
with my blood, sweat, and tears!

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:18.970
Raised it? Raised it how?

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:21.140
Making artificial flowers.

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:24.630
Now, my dear monsters.
If you'd be so kind.

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:34.990
That's right! Leave only that man alone!

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:37.320
Huh? And just what is that all about?

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:40.160
Don't tell me you're working with her!

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:41.660
Eh?

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:44.330
Hey, Xellos! Lend us a hand!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:48.670
Since I'm just a shadow,
all I can do is cheer you on.

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:52.670
A shadow! You mean you'll just
run away to where it's safe!?

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:55.010
You could put it that way, yes.

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:58.000
Oh, you jerk! In this case...

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:02.780
...we'd better run!

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:04.120
Oh! Miss Lina!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:05.610
Hey! Wait for me!

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:17.460
Darn it, if I could just fight back!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:25.300
An ambush. She must have
calculated we'd do this.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:29.300
How long can you hold out
without fighting?

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:33.970
Let's try it!

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:40.650
Lina!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:41.640
Miss Lina!

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:44.830
You fool!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.490
In this case...

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:47.660
Sure you want to do that?

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:52.160
If you use magic, the pain you'll
receive back will be considerable.

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:55.500
You're finished, Lina!

00:17:55.500 --> 00:18:01.270
And then Master Gourry and I can build
Zoamelgustar's kingdom together!

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:09.780
Oh, my fiancé, Gourry!
Watch as I kill Lina!

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:11.120
When did this happen?!

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:12.120
Yeah, when?!

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:14.450
I honestly don't know what
she's talking about!

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:16.460
Your fiancé?!

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:20.790
Who decided this and when?!

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:23.130
That's for me to know!

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:25.290
I decided it yesterday!

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:29.300
Uh, can I ask one question?

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:33.140
What's a "fiancé"?

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:35.640
Is it a pickle?

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:37.140
What? What?

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:40.310
What's a fiancé? Is it sour?
Salty? Tastes good?

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:42.980
Oh, can it, you jellyfish!

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:47.490
My companion must have brains
to go with his mighty body...

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:50.990
...and this idiot doesn't know
what a fiancé is?!

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.990
How dare you trick me!

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:55.830
Lady, you tricked yourself.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:59.170
Anyway, now I'm really mad!
You've really done it now!

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:01.940
Miss Lina! If you attack her,
you'll hurt yourself!

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.440
Don't you understand that?!

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:08.270
Hmpf! Yes! As long as I have this!

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:10.280
What the...

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:15.280
It would seem she just put
the curse on herself as well.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.450
Wh- When did you get here?!

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:21.280
What does it matter?
I'll just use my power to...

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.790
Looks like you just realized it.

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:28.630
If you break the curse for you,
you break it for me, too!

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.800
What do I do?! What do I do?!

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:34.630
I know! I can kill Lina
and then break the curse!

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:36.970
Isn't that right, Lord Zoamelgustar?

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:39.140
Yes, that's right! Well done, my follower!

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:41.810
Yes, lord! Well, then, here I go!

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:42.970
What?!

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:49.650
Idiots.

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:51.150
Cut this out and break the curse!

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:52.820
Not until I've killed you!

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:53.820
You stubborn girl!

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:55.160
Oh, yeah, washboard chest?!

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:56.160
What did you call me?!

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:56.990
So what if I did?!

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:58.160
Let's end this now!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:00.990
Yikes! Magic! This is getting too dangerous!

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:04.160
I don't care! I'm taking her down!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:06.170
Let's go!

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:09.000
Th- That look you have is scaring me!

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:13.000
Let's go for the pain! Fireball!

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:20.510
Well, I'll see you all later.

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:25.850
"It was a miserable battle..."

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:30.190
Ow! Oh, that stings! Ow...

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:32.190
So, you reap what you sow, right?

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:36.030
My chest isn't like a washboard...

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:38.700
They stick out like they're supposed to.

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:42.360
Next time, let's go to a hot spring
that'll grow your breast!

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:46.040
Idiots.

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:47.530
Here, have a drink.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:54.550
Mark my words, Lina Inverse!

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:57.550
The next time we meet,
it will be your doom!

00:20:57.550 --> 00:20:59.890
Wait for me and prepare to die!

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:02.150
Viva Zoamelgustar!

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:18.670
Something's taken control now.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:23.680
Your life's hopes and dreams are gone.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:27.510
Are you satisfied with your life now?

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:33.020
Got that fin de siecle feeling...

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:37.360
... and spend every day preparing.

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:40.530
So let's get your engine running!

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:42.860
Throw off all of...

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:46.530
... that rusty common sense!

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:51.700
You want to be the talk of the world!

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:54.870
You want to have a shining future!

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:57.380
That and this are your true dreams.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:01.140
Don't let anyone get in your way!

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:06.150
To be the talk of the world...

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:09.820
... let the greatness inside burst out!

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:12.160
You only get one break in life...

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:13.830
... so let's say bye- bye...

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:15.160
... to your timid self!

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:17.490
It's all right!

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:25.340
When it comes to traveling,
the best part is the locaI cuisine.

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:27.340
Which is Dragon Cuisine!

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:32.010
Next Episode is: " Sudden Cooking!
Follow the Phantom Dragon!"

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:34.500
If you don't watch,
I'll go berserk!
